车，针对性较强，可使红九路车迅速投入战斗。","text":"黑方直接车1进1较为少见，一般多走车9平4，视局势发展再为右车定位。红方及时平边炮通车，针对性较强，可使红九路车迅速投入战斗。","source_line_id":"0","source_after_ply":11,"anchor_node_id":"0:11","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false},{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment20:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment20","raw_text":"红方抢先吃马好棋，在交换中可多得一象，黑只好吃马，如炮5进4，则马七进五，炮2平7，马五进六抽车，红方胜定。","text":"红方抢先吃马好棋，在交换中可多得一象，黑只好吃马，如炮5进4，则马七进五，炮2平7，马五进六抽车，红方胜定。","source_line_id":"0","source_after_ply":20,"anchor_node_id":"0:20","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false},{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment24:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment24","raw_text":"红方进马有些急躁，致使中兵失守，局势失控，应走士四进五，再相机炮五平四，较为好下。黑趁势平车捉马好棋，由此反夺主动。","text":"红方进马有些急躁，致使中兵失守，局势失控，应走士四进五，再相机炮五平四，较为好下。黑趁势平车捉马好棋，由此反夺主动。","source_line_id":"0","source_after_ply":24,"anchor_node_id":"0:24","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false},{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment32:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment32","raw_text":"黑弃炮跃马，下伏严厉的进攻手段。","text":"黑弃炮跃马，下伏严厉的进攻手段。","source_line_id":"0","source_after_ply":32,"anchor_node_id":"0:32","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false},{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment34:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment34","raw_text":"红炮九进四缓不济急，在此紧要关头，红应相三进一先防一着，可延缓黑的反攻之势。黑车3平7好棋，可通过杀王得车。","text":"红炮九进四缓不济急，在此紧要关头，红应相三进一先防一着，可延缓黑的反攻之势。黑车3平7好棋，可通过杀王得车。","source_line_id":"0","source_after_ply":34,"anchor_node_id":"0:34","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false},{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment39:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment39","raw_text":"红炮击中卒扑空，是速败之着，应车三平八，战线尚长。","text":"红炮击中卒扑空，是速败之着，应车三平八，战线尚长。","source_line_id":"0","source_after_ply":39,"anchor_node_id":"0:39","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false},{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment42:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment42","raw_text":"趁势跃马叫杀兼有多种作用，轻松化解了红的攻势。","text":"趁势跃马叫杀兼有多种作用，轻松化解了红的攻势。","source_line_id":"0","source_after_ply":42,"anchor_node_id":"0:42","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false},{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment48:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment48","raw_text":"此时形势，黑平底车杀士叫将，入局干脆利落。","text":"此时形势，黑平底车杀士叫将，入局干脆利落。","source_line_id":"0","source_after_ply":48,"anchor_node_id":"0:48","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false},{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment50:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment50","raw_text":"黑胜。","text":"黑胜。","source_line_id":"0","source_after_ply":50,"anchor_node_id":"0:50","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false}],"issues":[],"metadata":{"DhtmlXQ_init":["500,350"],"DhtmlXQ_title":["059广西梁炳忠 先负 福建郭福人"],"DhtmlXQ_open":["D26 顺炮直车对横车"],"DhtmlXQ_remark":[""],"DhtmlXQ_author":[""],"DhtmlXQ_binit":["0919293949596979891777062646668600102030405060708012720323436383"]},"source_tag_count":16,"identical_tag_duplicates":0,"binit":"0919293949596979891777062646668600102030405060708012720323436383","side_to_move":"w","side_basis":"color of first source mover at binit square","standard_start":true,"summary":{"lines":1,"structured_branches":0,"line_statuses":{"legal":1},"source_move_records":50,"legal_move_records":50,"annotations":9,"annotation_statuses":{"attached":9}},"memberships":[{"book_id":"yl-book-66","category_id":"66","title":"第二章 顺手炮、列手炮 广西梁炳忠 先负 福建郭福人","catalogue_order":59,"directory_url":"https://m.xiangqiqipu.com/Category/List-66-3.html"}],"book_ids":["yl-book-66"]}}
